--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A-share (Chinese market) adaptations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following modules are original work contributed to this project and are
distributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0:

  tradingagents/dataflows/akshare_adapter.py
      A-share market data adapter: AkShare/BaoStock/TongdaXin multi-source
      fallback, rate limiting, exponential backoff, request timeouts, symbol
      normalization and stock-name resolution.

  tradingagents/dataflows/baostock_adapter.py
      BaoStock historical-data fallback provider.

  tradingagents/dataflows/cache_provider.py
      Local cache provider used as the last-resort fallback when all network
      sources are unavailable.

  tradingagents/dataflows/interface.py
      Vendor routing layer with per-category dispatch and fallback resolution.

  webui/
      FastAPI backend with WebSocket streaming and single-page web console.

  docs/
      Architecture walkthroughs and onboarding guides (in Chinese).

